BA-CHAANE DEEN KO SARWAR GALA KATATEY HAI <br>
KIYA JO RAB SE THA WADA USE NIBHAATEY HAI<br>
<br>
1. JO POCHA BANO NE ASHGER KAHAN HAI AYE WALI <br>
 HUSSAIN BANO KO LAASHE PISAR DEKHATEY HAI<br>
<br>
2. HUSSAIN FATHA KA ELAAN KARNE KO ASHGER <br>
 GALA PA TEER E SITAM KHAAKE MUSKURAATEY HAI<br>
<br>
3. TUMARA MARNE SE TOOTI KAMAR MERI BHAIYA <br>
 HUSSAIN GAZI KE LAASHE PE KEHTE JAATE HAI<br>
<br>
4. NA KOI MONISO YAWAR NA HAI ALAM BAR DAR <br>
 JAWAN KI LAASH KO MAIDAN SE SHAH UTHA HAI<br>
<br>
5. YE ROOKE KEHTI THI ZAINAB KE AAO AYE ABBAS <br>
 AADO TAMACHE SAKINA KO AB LAGATEY HAI<br>
<br>
6. SAKINA KEHTI THI AAKAR CHACHA ZARA DEKHO <br>
 DEKHA KE PAANI ZAMEEN PAR ADO BAHATEY HAI<br>
<br>
7. DUA E DETI HAI UN KO HUSSAIN KI MADAR <br>
 GHAR O MEIN APNE JO FARSH E AZA BECHATEY HAI<br>
<br>
8. HAI JISKE DIL ME ZIYARAT KI AARZOO SAHIL <br>
 ZAROR USKU SHAH E KARBALA BULATEY HAI<br>
